## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Phase 0 — mint + hard validator** (`c0cc36a`) — confirmed by: tsc·0 / vitest 1014 /
  replay-pilot 30/30. `renumberShotsContinuous` now RECONSTRUCTS every id from position
  via `canonicalShotId` (model output overwritten); `collectShotIdViolations` validates
  `^S\d+-E\d+-SH\d+$` and HALTs; `maxActInShotIds` removed (triple act-invariant → double
  `act-objects===scriptActs`).
- **Phase 1 — SSOT module + button-number** (`ec93d3e`) — confirmed by: tsc·0 / vitest
  1022 / replay 30. New `lib/api/shot-id.ts` (SHOT_ID_RE, episodeShort, canonicalShotId,
  resolveShotId). Trigger route resolves `7`/`SH7`/full → canonical via `resolveShotId`.
- **Phase 2 — delete band-aids** (`810f6df`) — confirmed by: tsc·0 / vitest 1010 / replay
  30. Deleted normalizeShotId + FULL/BARE REs + shotIdsMatchLoose + getStoryboardShotById
  SH-fallback → exact `===`. EREF-critic landmine closed (SHOT_ID_REF_RE → SHOT_ID_RE).
- **Phase 3+4 — label + fixtures** (`9960320`) — confirmed by: tsc·0 / vitest 1010 / replay
  30. shortShotLabel → SH token; mock-providers + runner emit canonicalShotId.
- **Phase 3-UI — feed/gallery** (`443a82d`) — confirmed by: tsc·0 / vitest 1010. Labels →
  SH token; activity-feed shows version (pulled from filename already in event title
  `…-v03-`, zero plumbing) → "approve SH101 ref plan v03"; gallery "SH03 · v03 · APPROVED".
- **Net delta** — confirmed by `git diff --stat`: my 16 files = +328 / −378 = **net −50 LoC**
  (incl. new 63-line SSOT module + 69-line new test). Subtractive, as promised.

