## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Initial 🔴 context-warning self-estimates** — failed because: I assumed a 200k window
  and flagged ~60-65% prematurely. `/context` revealed the real window is 1M (was at 26%,
  74% free). Don't guess context %; the window is large — keep working.
- **`grep` on `storyboarder.ts`** — treated as binary (a `\0` byte ~offset 25243). Use
  `grep -a` or the Read tool. The file compiles fine (tsc·0) — the null byte is benign.
- **`npx tsc`** — grabbed a stub ("not the tsc you are looking for"). Use
  `node_modules/.bin/tsc`.
- **Bash cwd resets between some calls** — start each Bash with
  `cd /c/SandyStudio/.claude/worktrees/sweet-meninsky-5dd7b6/webapp && …` when using
  relative paths.
- **5 unit tests failed after Phase 2** (expected) — they ENCODED the deleted band-aid
  (bare/canonical loose-match). Fixed by repointing them to exact-match + S-E-SH semantics,
  NOT by weakening the code.

