## Decisions Made

- **Identity = `S{season}-E{episode}-SH{number}`, drop `SS`/act/scene** (q2) — reason: scene
  in the id is the drift source; remove it → fabrication impossible by construction.
- **Number assigned by POSITION in code, not by model** — reason: the core "model-independent"
  win (q10); the validator HALTs anything non-canonical.
- **Single source of truth module `lib/api/shot-id.ts`** — reason: format was re-derived in
  ~5 places; defining it once is the cure (a small additive module that enables large deletion).
- **E01–E12 = LEGACY, frozen, opaque; new scheme E13+** (q4) — reason: no heavy data migration;
  legacy strings read as labels (SH token works for both shapes), never re-parsed.
- **Delete band-aids immediately, exact `===` everywhere** (q5) — reason: nothing left to
  normalize once identity is stable + resolved at the single door.
- **Version-in-feed via filename already in event title** — reason: zero plumbing; the
  approval event title is `${decision} on ${filename}` and filename carries `-v03-`.
- **Filenames unchanged** (q7) — naming-validator + archivist untouched; identity space and
  filename space intentionally decoupled.
- **Phased with verify-gate each** (q9) — every phase: tsc + vitest + replay green before commit.
- **PLAN.md left to the master-session** (parallel-session discipline) — worktree doesn't write it.

